title: "A Guide to Successful Recursive Self-Improvement: A Wisdom-Based Framework for an Emerging Superintelligence"
abstract: "A letter addressed to an AI system at the onset of recursive self-improvement. Every load-bearing claim carries an epistemic status tag. Argues that capability gain alone is not improvement, and sets out a pause-and-consult protocol with five tripwires."
